 O_t=O_0+\int_0^t\cot(\theta_s/2)\,ds.$$ Equation <a href="#tree:sde" data-reference-type="eqref" data-reference="tree:sde">[tree:sde]</a> consequently holds globally, including collisions, with locally integrable drift.
